    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://jackmordaunt.com/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://jackmordaunt.com/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I’m Jack, an Australian developer living abroad, building lean, native software in Odin and Go.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I care deeply about software that’s organically made and designed to be robust, efficient and promote self-sovereignty.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have a particular interest in long-term software built to last decades.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I believe this is best achieved by having a small dependency tree and re-using modular libraries written in C where possible, which is the lowest-common denominator and what drives my interest in Odin: a C alternative built for the joy of programming.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
